---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { services } from '../data/services';
---
<BaseLayout title="FenceCraft | Built on experience. Made for you." description="FenceCraft brings over 40 years of practical experience to fencing, decking, landscaping and park maintenance across Flintshire, Wrexham, Chester and the Wirral.">
  <section class="wrap heritage-hero"><div class="heritage-copy"><p class="eyebrow">GOOD OLD-FASHIONED CARE. BEAUTIFULLY FINISHED.</p><h1>Built on experience.<br />Made for you.</h1><p class="intro">Fencing, decking and landscaping for homes, plus grounds maintenance for caravan parks across Flintshire, Wrexham, Chester and the Wirral.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn" href="/request-a-quote/">Request a free quote <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/services/">See how we can help ↗</a></div><p class="hero-meta">Flintshire · Wrexham · Chester · Wirral<br />Free, no-obligation quotations</p></div><figure class="heritage-photo"><img src="/assets/garden-1200.webp" srcset="/assets/garden-640.webp 640w, /assets/garden-1200.webp 1200w, /assets/garden-1800.webp 1800w" sizes="(max-width:600px) 100vw, 42vw" width="1800" height="1200" alt="Illustrative garden with timber fencing, lawn and planting" fetchpriority="high" /><div class="experience-seal"><strong>40+</strong><small>YEARS OF<br />EXPERIENCE</small></div></figure></section>
  <section class="client-band"><div class="wrap client-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">A WORKING RELATIONSHIP BUILT OVER TIME</p><h2>Wyldecrest Parks</h2></div><div><p>Over 20 years carrying out work for Wyldecrest Parks in Wrexham and Flintshire.</p><a class="text-link" href="/for-parks/">A little more about our park work ↗</a></div><span class="relationship-mark">20+<small>YEARS OF WORK</small></span></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE HELP. A BIGGER PROJECT. ONGOING CARE.</p><h2>What can we<br />take care of for you?</h2></div><p class="muted">Good work starts with understanding what you need. Choose the route that fits your plans.</p></div><div class="route-grid"><a class="route-card" href="/for-your-home/"><div class="route-photo"><img src="/assets/garden-1200.webp" width="1800" height="1200" loading="lazy" alt="Illustrative home garden with timber fencing" /></div><div class="route-copy"><p class="eyebrow">FOR HOMEOWNERS</p><h3>Your home. Your garden. <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>A little more privacy, a place to sit or a fresh start outside. Let’s make your garden work for you.</p><div class="service-list-inline">Fencing &amp; repairs · Glass fencing · Decking<br />Landscaping · Patios &amp; paving</div></div></a><a class="route-card" href="/for-parks/"><div class="route-photo"><img src="/assets/park-1200.webp" width="1800" height="1200" loading="lazy" alt="Illustrative park home with decking and glass balustrades" /></div><div class="route-copy"><p class="eyebrow">FOR PARKS &amp; PARK-HOME OWNERS</p><h3>Your park. Taken care of. <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>From one-off improvements to ongoing upkeep. Practical experience across the grounds and beyond.</p><div class="service-list-inline">Park maintenance · Static-caravan painting<br />Footings &amp; groundworks · Fencing &amp; decking</div></div></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section sage"><div class="wrap split"><img src="/assets/patio-1200.webp" width="1800" height="1200" loading="lazy" alt="Illustrative patio and garden planting" /><div><p class="eyebrow">THE EXPERIENCE BEHIND THE EVERYDAY DETAILS</p><h2>Some things<br />are worth doing properly.</h2><p class="intro">A fence that feels right. A deck that makes space for everyday life. A park that’s cared for over the years.</p><p class="muted">FenceCraft brings decades of practical experience to outdoor work. Tell us what you have in mind, and we’ll talk through the options and the next steps.</p><div class="owner-story">A local business with over 40 years of experience, including more than 20 years carrying out work for Wyldecrest Parks in Wrexham and Flintshire.</div><p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">A little more about FenceCraft ↗</a></p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">FROM BOUNDARIES TO BIGGER PLANS</p><h2>Good hands.<br />Plenty of know-how.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/services/">Explore all our services ↗</a></div><div class="services-six">{services.slice(0,6).map((service, i) => <a href={`/services/${service.slug}/`}><span class="number">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')} /</span><h3>{service.title} ↗</h3><p>{service.short}</p></a>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="section white"><div class="wrap split"><div><p class="eyebrow">FOR PARK MANAGERS &amp; PARK-HOME OWNERS</p><h2>From the footings<br />to the finishing touch.</h2><p class="intro">Decking, glass fencing, static-caravan painting and grounds maintenance.</p><p class="muted">Whether it’s a specific job or a longer-term maintenance requirement, start with the park location and what needs doing.</p><a class="btn" href="/request-a-quote/?project=park">Request a free quote <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><img src="/assets/park-1200.webp" width="1800" height="1200" loading="lazy" alt="Illustrative park-home decking concept" /></div></section>
  <section class="section sage"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">NO PRESSURE. JUST A PRACTICAL NEXT STEP.</p><h2>Start with a conversation.</h2><div class="process"><article><div class="step">01 /</div><h3>Tell us your plans</h3><p>Share your postcode, the work you’re considering and a few details about the project or maintenance work.</p></article><article><div class="step">02 /</div><h3>Explore the practicalities</h3><p>Discuss materials, access and scope. A site visit may be needed for an accurate quotation.</p></article><article><div class="step">03 /</div><h3>Agree the next steps</h3><p>Review the quotation and agree the work and timing before moving ahead.</p></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">PICTURE THE POSSIBILITIES</p><h2>A little inspiration<br />for outside.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/projects/">Explore the gallery ↗</a></div><div class="proof-grid"><figure class="project"><img src="/assets/garden-1200.webp" width="1800" height="1200" loading="lazy" alt="Illustrative fencing and landscaping concept" /><figcaption><span>A more private garden</span><span class="tag">CONCEPT IMAGE</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="project secondary"><img src="/assets/park-1200.webp" width="1800" height="1200" loading="lazy" alt="Illustrative park-home decking concept" /><figcaption><span>A fresh outlook for park life</span><span class="tag">CONCEPT IMAGE</span></figcaption></figure></div><p class="evidence-note">These images show the design direction. The finished gallery will use genuine FenceCraft work; the park image is not a Wyldecrest location.</p></div></section>
  <section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">REQUEST A FREE QUOTE</p><h2>Tell us what you have in mind.</h2><p>A new fence, a garden project or a park that needs looking after. We’re happy to talk it through.</p></div><a class="btn gold" href="/request-a-quote/">Request a free quote <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap faq-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE WE GET STARTED</p><h2>A few helpful answers.</h2></div><div><details><summary>Where do you work?</summary><p>FenceCraft lists coverage across Flintshire, Cheshire, Wrexham and the Wirral. Share your postcode so availability and the practicalities of your project can be confirmed.</p></details><details><summary>Is the quotation free?</summary><p>FenceCraft offers free, no-obligation quotations. A site visit may be needed to understand the work and provide an accurate price.</p></details><details><summary>How quickly will I hear back?</summary><p>For an initial conversation, call 07935 190681 or use the enquiry form.</p></details><details><summary>Do you work with caravan parks?</summary><p>Yes. FenceCraft carries out park maintenance, static-caravan painting, footing works, fencing and decking. Tell us the location and the work you need to discuss availability and scope.</p></details></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
